# Every VITE_-prefixed value is compiled into the public bundle and served to
# whoever loads the client: never a place for a secret. web/.env is gitignored,
# and a secret put there still ships inside dist/.
#
# Where the client reaches the service: the API's own subdomain, cross-origin
# under CORS, never through a Vercel rewrite (docs/adr/ADR-0006-deployment-topology.md
# § D4). An absolute http(s) URL; a trailing slash is dropped.
#
# Set it in the Vercel project's environment: unset, a Vercel build fails.
# Unset anywhere else, every mode falls back to http://127.0.0.1:8080, the
# service's local address, and `npm run build` warns. A value that is not an
# absolute http(s) URL fails the build.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.org
